  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 1.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et omnis qui familiam habet efficiat, ut omnis hyremannus suus det unum denarium. Qui si non habeat, det dominus eius pro eo; et omnis tainus decimet totum quicquid habet.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And everyone who has a household shall see to it that each of his dependants gives a penny. If anyone is without money, his lord shall give it for him; and every thegn shall render a tithe of all that he has.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
